  "kept_note": "Wraps whose MuJoCo 3 path no side site gives under the MuJoCo 4 rule, mostly because the MuJoCo 3 path itself flips sides inside the range of motion. They keep their site, so MuJoCo 3 is unchanged and MuJoCo 4 differs by the amounts here. 'site_without_jump' is a site that would give one jump-free path on both versions, at the stated change from MuJoCo 3; not applied.",
